WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.758
Open the bundled conveyor example and wait until it is ready.

2
00:00:23.763 --> 00:00:47.670
Open the current document menu and choose Demo package.

3
00:00:47.670 --> 00:01:19.527
Set the initial view, add a shot and enter its title and description.

4
00:01:19.527 --> 00:01:40.950
Save the tour recipe. It does not contain the model; keep the model separately.

5
00:01:40.950 --> 00:02:10.374
Export demo HTML and wait for the complete download before delivery.

6
00:02:10.374 --> 00:02:42.800
Open the downloaded file offline. Play the tour, drag to take over, then reset the view.
